message: "If you use design-extractor in published work, cite it as below."
title: "design-extractor"
abstract: "Reverse-engineers a live website into a design system an agent can rebuild from: real source, resolved CSS cascade, design tokens, motion tracks, interaction states, framework components, and an offline-replayable copy of every captured file, scored against the original with a pixel diff."
